  "prefLabel": "Nur 502.01 Applicability",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Nur 502.01 Applicability. This part shall apply to the prescribing of opioids for the treatment of non-cancer and non-terminal pain, and shall not apply to the supervised administration of opioids in a health care setting.\n\nSource. #11117, eff 6-9-16; ss by #12070, eff 1-1-17",
